{"title":"44","section":"1901","heading":"Definition of Government publication","lead":"“Government publication” as used in this chapter, means informational matter which is published as an individual document at Government expense, or as required by law.","tree":[],"notes":[{"topic":"historicalAndRevision","heading":"Historical and Revision Notes","text":"Based on 44 U.S. Code, 1964 ed., § 81a (Pub. L. 87–579, § 1, Aug. 9, 1962, 76 Stat. 352)."}],"sourceCredit":"(Pub. L. 90–620, Oct. 22, 1968, 82 Stat. 1283.)","releasePoint":"119-102","ancestors":[{"type":"title","num":"Title 44—","heading":"PUBLIC PRINTING AND DOCUMENTS","identifier":"/us/usc/t44"},{"type":"chapter","num":"CHAPTER 19—","heading":"DEPOSITORY LIBRARY PROGRAM","identifier":"/us/usc/t44/ch19"}]}